# Copy this file to .env for settings that differ per machine. The justfile
# loads .env, and a variable set in the shell wins over it. .env is git-ignored.

# The Godot binary. The default is the app bundle on macOS and `godot` on PATH
# elsewhere.
# GODOT_BIN=/path/to/godot

# The most Godot processes that run at once. The default, auto, is the number of
# CPU cores. Set a number when parallel agents run out of memory.
# GODOT_SLOTS=4

# The folder that holds sonny-2-2900.swf and SONNY2.swf. Set it in your shell
# profile, not here: a new git worktree has no .env, and the variable must
# reach every worktree. The default is the repo root.
# URCHIN_SWF_DIR=~/Games/sonny2

# The players of `just trace-run`. The defaults are the Flash 14 debug player
# of Flashpoint 14 and the Ruffle app on macOS.
# FLASH_DEBUG_PLAYER=~/Games/Flashpoint_14/FPSoftware/Flash/Flash 14.app/Contents/MacOS/Flash Player Debugger
# RUFFLE_BIN=/Applications/Ruffle.app/Contents/MacOS/ruffle
# On WSL2, the Windows debug player of Flashpoint and Ruffle from Homebrew:
# FLASH_DEBUG_PLAYER=/mnt/c/Flashpoint/FPSoftware/Flash/flashplayer11_9r900_152_win_sa_debug.exe
# RUFFLE_BIN=/home/linuxbrew/.linuxbrew/bin/ruffle
